# Skyward Spider: "This creature has flying as long as it's modified" (CR 700.9, 604.1, 613.1f). Bot1 casts the Spider and a Basilisk
# Collar with Moxen; with no counter, Equipment or Aura it has no flying. On turn 3 Bot1 equips the Collar to the Spider, which is
# modified now and has flying, then moves it to its Memnite, and the Spider loses flying again (the Memnite, equipped, does not gain it).

